or codes them to the appropriate flight category, then displays them in a format similar to that of a calendar, helping you to see trends at a glance.\n\nUnique to this app is a robust alerting system, which monitors changing flight categories and notifies you based on alert conditions you choose. For example, if you want to know when your departure airport turns from IFR to VFR, tap a few settings, and you'll get an alert when the change occurs.\n\n• Seven days of history\n• Formatted to local time\n• Plain Language Translation \n• Flight Category Alerts \n\n\nhttps://www.METARs.com", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "21053440", "formattedPrice": "￦11,000", "trackContentRating": "4+", "sellerUrl": "https://www.aviationmobileapps.com/metars-aviation-weather", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "minimumOsVersion": "9.0", "userRatingCount": 0}]}